sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin Akademik
    participant Service as Scheduling Service
    participant Subject as ScheduleSubject
    participant Student as StudentObserver
    participant Lecturer as LecturerObserver
    participant KRS as KRS Service
    Admin->>Service: update jadwal
    Service->>Service: cek konflik dan kapasitas
    Service->>KRS: invalidate KRS terdampak
    Service->>Subject: notify(SCHEDULE_CHANGED)
    Subject->>Student: update(event)
    Subject->>Lecturer: update(event)
    Subject-->>Admin: status perubahan jadwal
